==Restrictions==
*Fixed lineup: [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]].

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage introduces a Shy Boy: a melee enemy with rapid attacks capable of shredding your front line.

With the provided units, this stage shouldn't be very difficult. Spamming meatshields along with stacking your [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] while sending out [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie]] every time she's off cooldown will help beat this stage easily.

==Hints==
The first hint can be viewed within the Enemies Appearing window before beginning the stage. The second and third only appear as defeat messages given after failing it.
*Speedy and relentless enemies<br>can be held back by deploying <br>Units that are low-cost<br>and have high Vitality
*Deploy Macho Cat and Wall Cat in rapid<br>succession to stop the enemy's advance.<br>If you remember one thing... remember this!
*Deploy Macho Cat and Wall Cat in rapid<br>succession to stop the enemy's advance.<br>This technique will always come in handy!

